#
#  DDL CRASH SAFE TEST 01: Test all DDL write DDL info to WAL correctly.
#
#  In this test, we will execute almost all DDL type query, and kill the
#  server. After that, we check whether DDL infos can be read from WAL.
#  This is the basic we can do safe recovery.
#
# Step 1. Pepare Data For Test.
